# FreshHaul System Diagrams

This file groups the main diagrams that describe the FreshHaul platform from business, software, data, and deployment perspectives.

## 1. System Context Diagram

Description: Shows the main users, the FreshHaul platform, and the external services it depends on.

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    Farmer[Farmer]
    Driver[Driver / Transporter]
    Admin[Admin / Staff]

    System[FreshHaul Platform]

    Maps[Mapping Services\nOpenStreetMap / Nominatim / OSRM]
    Daraja[Safaricom Daraja]
    Email[SMTP Email Provider]
    DB[(SQLite / PostgreSQL)]

    Farmer -->|Create bookings,\ntrack deliveries,\npay for transport| System
    Driver -->|Manage vehicles,\naccept jobs,\nupdate delivery status| System
    Admin -->|Manage pricing,\nreview reports,\nmonitor bookings| System

    System -->|Place search,\nreverse geocoding,\nroute preview| Maps
    System -->|STK Push,\npayment callback| Daraja
    System -->|Verification email,\npassword reset email| Email
    System --> DB
```

